OL,3,GNEWSARider who died after motocross
OL,4,Acrash named
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old cyclist who died after a
OL,7,Fcrash on a motocross track has been
OL,8,Fnamed by a coroner.
OL,10,FRichie Anderson, a former Margate FC
OL,11,Fyouth player, was seriously injured
OL,12,Fduring an open session at Flackwell
OL,13,FHeath Moto Park in High Wycombe,
OL,14,FBuckinghamshire, on 19 September. He
OL,15,Fdied two days later.
OL,17,FIn a social media post, the venue said
OL,18,FAnderson, who was at the track every
OL,19,Fweekend, "had such a genuine, kind
OL,20,Fnature that you couldn't help but like
OL,21,Fhim".
